OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly
OL,6,Fcloudy with showers or longer spells
OL,7,Fof rain, these heavy at times through
OL,8,Fthe evening and overnight. Strong
OL,9,Fsoutherly winds with gales developing
OL,10,Facross Dumfries and Galloway.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA mixture of bright spells
OL,13,Fand showers, some heavy. A windy day
OL,14,Ftoo with southwesterly gales.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA
OL,17,Fmuch quieter end to the week with some
OL,18,Fshowers at times but also dry and
OL,19,Fbright weather. Still rather breezy at
OL,20,Ftimes.
